    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just exhausting though. the thought of starting over, or even just sitting here trying to \"be\" someone else... it feels so pointless. everything i cared about is gone and i'm just stuck in this void where nothing matters anymore. it feels like the math of my life just doesn't add up anymore. like there's no reason to keep trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken.",
